{
  "key": 8359,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Only the chosen may enter\n",
        "the Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "I’m sorry, but you will have to\n",
        "leave.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Only the chosen may enter\n",
        "the Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "I’m sorry, but you will have to\n",
        "leave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The temple is said to have been\n",
        "built in ancient times.\r",
        "It pays homage to the Pokémon\n",
        "of rock, ice, and steel that shape\\fthe land.\r",
        "So it is told."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice: It’s OK!\n",
        "You can let that person in.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia sent word to me.\r",
        "You’re working on a Pokédex,\n",
        "aren’t you?\r",
        "There should be many rare Pokémon\n",
        "in the temple.\r",
        "Enjoy your exploring!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Brrr... This snowbound town is\n",
        "always freezing cold.\r",
        "But the spirits of the Trainers and\n",
        "their Pokémon burn hot and bright.\r",
        "Especially the Gym Leader."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Ewww, aren’t you cold with just\n",
        "that scarf? Yikes!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re going to the Snowpoint Temple?\n",
        "You know you’re not allowed to go in?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re going to the Snowpoint Temple?\n",
        "Some awesome Pokémon are there!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice is teaching me about Pokémon.\r",
        "She says I have to start by making\n",
        "friends with Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "What is it? Do you want to sail\n",
        "to the Battle Zone?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Aye, aye, then!\n",
        "Let’s set sail!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "What is it?\n",
        "The Battle Zone’s rough to get to.\r",
        "The sea around it is always roiling\n",
        "with choppy waves.\r",
        "You can’t go there using Surf,\n",
        "that’s for sure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "A great Trainer recognized by\n",
        "the Pokémon League...\r",
        "I look forward to carrying someone\n",
        "like that on this ship!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s nothing here!\n",
        "And that’s what makes us unique."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Snowpoint City\n",
        "City of Snow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1140_SC09_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Snowpoint City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Candice\\fThe Diamond Dust Girl!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}